{"ref":"passive:duplicator","lead":[{"k":"p","c":["Duplicator is a passive item in Vampire Survivors. It is unlocked by getting the ",{"t":"Magic Wand","r":"weapon:magic-wand"}," to Level 7."]},{"k":"p","c":["Duplicator increases ",{"t":"Amount","r":"powerup:amount"}," by +1 per level."]},{"k":"p","c":["Duplicator is required for the evolution of ",{"t":"Lightning Ring","r":"weapon:lightning-ring"},", ",{"t":"Thunder Loop","r":"weapon:thunder-loop"},". It is also required for the evolution of ",{"t":"Summon Night","r":"weapon:summon-night"},", ",{"t":"Echo Night","r":"weapon:echo-night"},", in which Duplicator must also be fully leveled."]},{"k":"p","c":["Duplicator can be found as a stage item in ",{"t":"Cappella Magna","r":"stage:cappella-magna"},", ",{"t":"Moongolow","r":"stage:moongolow"},", ",{"t":"Boss Rash","r":"stage:boss-rash"},", and ",{"t":"Mt.Moonspell","r":"stage:mt-moonspell"},"."]}],"infobox":[{"title":"Passive item","rows":[{"label":"Release","cells":[["27 October 2021 (Update)"]]},{"label":"ID","cells":[["AMOUNT"]]},{"label":"Player stat","cells":[[{"t":"Amount","r":"powerup:amount"}]]},{"label":"Rarity","cells":[["50"]]},{"label":"Max level","cells":[["2"]]},{"label":"Bonus per level","cells":[["+1"]]},{"label":"Stacking","cells":[["Additive"]]},{"label":"Max effect","cells":[["+2"]]},{"label":"Stage item","cells":[[{"t":"Cappella Magna","r":"stage:cappella-magna"},", ",{"t":"Moongolow","r":"stage:moongolow"},", ",{"t":"Boss Rash","r":"stage:boss-rash"},", ",{"t":"Mt.Moonspell","r":"stage:mt-moonspell"}]]}]}],"sections":[{"id":"levels","title":"Levels","blocks":[{"k":"p","c":["Duplicator has 2 levels. At max level, Duplicator provides +2 ",{"t":"Amount","r":"powerup:amount"},"."]},{"k":"table","rows":[{"h":1,"cells":[{"c":["Level"],"h":1},{"c":["Description"],"h":1}]},{"cells":[{"c":["Level 1"]},{"c":["\"Weapons fire more projectiles.\""]}]},{"cells":[{"c":["Level 2"]},{"c":["Fires 1 more projectile."]}]}]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"evolutions","title":"Evolutions","blocks":[{"k":"table","rows":[{"h":1,"cells":[{"c":["Base weapon"],"h":1},{"c":[],"h":1},{"c":["Passive item"],"h":1},{"c":[],"h":1},{"c":["Evolution"],"h":1}]},{"cells":[{"c":[{"i":"Sprite-Lightning_Ring.png","w":32,"h":32,"r":"weapon:lightning-ring"},"\n",{"t":"Lightning Ring","r":"weapon:lightning-ring"}]},{"c":["+"]},{"c":[{"i":"Sprite-Duplicator.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"passive:duplicator"},"\nDuplicator"]},{"c":["="]},{"c":[{"i":"Sprite-Thunder_Loop.png","w":32,"h":32,"r":"weapon:thunder-loop"},"\n",{"t":"Thunder Loop","r":"weapon:thunder-loop"}]}]},{"cells":[{"c":[{"i":"Sprite-Summon_Night.png","w":32,"h":32,"r":"weapon:summon-night"},"\n",{"t":"Summon Night","r":"weapon:summon-night"}]},{"c":["+"]},{"c":["Max level:\n",{"i":"Sprite-Duplicator.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"passive:duplicator"},"\nDuplicator"]},{"c":["="]},{"c":[{"i":"Sprite-Echo_Night.png","w":32,"h":32,"r":"weapon:echo-night"},"\n",{"t":"Echo Night","r":"weapon:echo-night"}]}]},{"cells":[{"c":[{"i":"Sprite-Homing_Miss.png","w":32,"h":32,"r":"weapon:homing-miss"},"\n",{"t":"Homing Miss","r":"weapon:homing-miss"}]},{"c":["+"]},{"c":[{"i":"Sprite-Duplicator.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"passive:duplicator"},"\nDuplicator+",{"i":"Sprite-Weapon_Power-Up.png","w":32,"h":32,"r":"passive:weapon-power-up"},"\n",{"t":"Weapon Power-Up","r":"passive:weapon-power-up"}]},{"c":["="]},{"c":[{"i":"Sprite-Multistage_Missiles.png","w":32,"h":32,"r":"weapon:multistage-missiles"},"\n",{"t":"Multistage Missiles","r":"weapon:multistage-missiles"}]}]},{"cells":[{"c":[{"i":"Sprite-Fulgur.png","w":28,"h":32,"r":"weapon:fulgur"},"\n",{"t":"Fulgur","r":"weapon:fulgur"}]},{"c":["+"]},{"c":["Max level:\n",{"i":"Sprite-Duplicator.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"passive:duplicator"},"\nDuplicator"]},{"c":["="]},{"c":[{"i":"Sprite-Tenebris_Tonitrus.png","w":32,"h":32,"r":"weapon:tenebris-tonitrus"},"\n",{"t":"Tenebris Tonitrus","r":"weapon:tenebris-tonitrus"}]}]},{"cells":[{"c":[{"i":"Sprite-Trident.png","w":32,"h":32,"r":"weapon:trident"},"\n",{"t":"Trident","r":"weapon:trident"}]},{"c":["+"]},{"c":["Max level:\n",{"i":"Sprite-Duplicator.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"passive:duplicator"},"\nDuplicator"]},{"c":["="]},{"c":[{"i":"Sprite-Gungnir-Souris.png","w":32,"h":32,"r":"weapon:gungnir-souris"},"\n",{"t":"Gungnir-Souris","r":"weapon:gungnir-souris"}]}]},{"cells":[{"c":[{"i":"Sprite-Ashella.png","w":32,"h":32,"r":"weapon:ashella"},"\n",{"t":"Ashella","r":"weapon:ashella"}]},{"c":["+"]},{"c":["Max level:\n",{"i":"Sprite-Duplicator.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"passive:duplicator"},"\nDuplicator"]},{"c":["="]},{"c":[{"i":"Sprite-Bloodlust.png","w":32,"h":32,"r":"weapon:bloodlust"},"\n",{"t":"Bloodlust","r":"weapon:bloodlust"}]}]}]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"tips","title":"Tips","blocks":[{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["Duplicator is a great passive item, as it boosts the effectiveness of most weapons by a large amount. Extra projectiles leads to extra damage and extra protection from enemies."]},{"c":["Amount bonuses work for some weapons better than others. High-damage weapons with a low rate of fire, such as the ",{"i":"Sprite-Axe.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:axe"}," ",{"t":"Axe","r":"weapon:axe"}," and ",{"i":"Sprite-Fire_Wand.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:fire-wand"}," ",{"t":"Fire Wand","r":"weapon:fire-wand"},", perform better when paired with the Duplicator, but weapons such as the ",{"i":"Sprite-Magic_Wand.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:magic-wand"}," ",{"t":"Magic Wand","r":"weapon:magic-wand"}," benefit less due to the already high amount of low-damage projectiles."]}]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"update-history","title":"Update history","blocks":[{"k":"p","c":["This information has been manually compiled. Some updates may not be included yet."]},{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["update 27 October 2021 (Update):"],"sub":{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["Added to game."]}]}}]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"trivia","title":"Trivia","blocks":[{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["Duplicator and ",{"i":"Sprite-Tirajisú.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"passive:tirajisu"}," ",{"t":"Tirajisú","r":"passive:tirajisu"}," are the only passive items with a max level of 2 instead of the usual 5."]},{"c":["Duplicator is likely a reference to the ",{"t":"Duplicator","x":"https://castlevania.fandom.com/wiki/Duplicator"}," accessory of the same name from ",{"t":"Castlevania: Symphony of the Night","x":"https://castlevania.fandom.com/wiki/Castlevania:_Symphony_of_the_Night"},", which allows items to be used an infinite number of times, at the cost of decreased stats and being an extremely expensive item purchaseable only after finishing the game once beforehand."]}]}],"subs":[]}]}